TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;BYMONTHDAY=1
SUMMARY:Monthly menopause check-in
DESCRIPTION:Five minutes\, once a month:\n• How many hot flushes or night
  sweats this month\, roughly?\n• Sleep: better\, same or worse?\n• Per
 iods: dates\, flow\, any gaps or unusual bleeding?\n• Mood\, brain fog\,
  joint aches\, anything new?\n\nWrite it down while it's fresh. Unusual bl
 eeding\, especially after periods have stopped\, is worth raising with a c
 linician promptly.\n\n—\nFrom My Midlife Story: Menopause\, free on the 
 App Store: https://apps.apple.com/us/app/my-midlife-story-menopause/id6814
 637835?pt=129123876&ct=cal-menopause-symptom-check-in-cal&mt=8\nAbout this
  calendar: https://honestlittleapps.github.io/calendars/menopause-symptom-
 check-in-calendar/
URL:https://apps.apple.com/us/app/my-midlife-story-menopause/id6814637835?p
 t=129123876&ct=cal-menopause-symptom-check-in-cal&mt=8
END:VEVENT
