RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=SU
SUMMARY:2-minute symptom log
DESCRIPTION:Quick log for the week: sleep\, hot flushes\, mood\, energy\, c
 ycle. Patterns are much easier to spot (and to explain at an appointment) 
 when they're written down weekly instead of remembered.\n\n—\nFrom My Mi
 dlife Story: Menopause\, free on the App Store: https://apps.apple.com/us/
 app/my-midlife-story-menopause/id6814637835?pt=129123876&ct=cal-menopause-
 symptom-check-in-cal&mt=8\nAbout this calendar: https://honestlittleapps.g
 ithub.io/calendars/menopause-symptom-check-in-calendar/
