SUMMARY:World Menopause Day
DESCRIPTION:October 18 is World Menopause Day\, promoted by the Internation
 al Menopause Society. A good day to book the check-up you've been putting 
 off\, or to share what you've learned with a friend.\n\n—\nFrom My Midli
 fe Story: Menopause\, free on the App Store: https://apps.apple.com/us/app
