SUMMARY:Before your appointment: prepare your summary
DESCRIPTION:New year\, new appointment? Bring a one-page summary: symptoms 
 with rough frequency\, cycle dates\, sleep\, medications and supplements\,
  and your top 3 questions. It makes a 10-minute appointment far more usefu
 l.\n\n—\nFrom My Midlife Story: Menopause\, free on the App Store: https
